              <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold">PDF · Word · CSV · Photo</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/admin/questions/template/download" class="text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-700 bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-indigo-100">Download Excel template</a>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">Upload files <strong>right here</strong>. A page may contain <strong>1, 10, 100 or any number of questions</strong>. Typed text, scanned pages and handwritten A/B/C/D questions are extracted into editable MCQs before publishing.</p>

          <% if (typeof aiEnabled !== 'undefined' && !aiEnabled) { %>
          <div class="mb-4 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-xs text-amber-800">
            <strong>PDF/Word/photo scanning needs configuration:</strong> add <code class="bg-amber-100 px-1 rounded">GEMINI_API_KEY</code> or <code class="bg-amber-100 px-1 rounded">OPENAI_API_KEY</code> in <code class="bg-amber-100 px-1 rounded">.env</code>. CSV/Excel works without it.
          </div>
